<font size="+2">SHARE</font><br><br>

You ask me<br>
who I am<br>
you wonder<br>
where I'm from<br><br>
You see me standing tall<br>
proud of what I've become<br><br>
You whisper to yourself<br>
you wish to know the truth<br>
you seek to know if you and I<br>
can beat that same old drum<br><br>
I answer you with confidence<br>
and tell you what's in mind<br>
for you and I and all of us<br>
do share this great old land<br><br>
We share a future in this life<br>
our destinies coincide<br>
we sketch a common history<br>
by same law we abide<br><br>
You and I and all of us<br>
must share a banner and a spear<br>
together you and I will stand<br>
to conquer that same fear.<br>
</td>
</tr>
